Error [E0914]: unknown interpolation selector `#Repr`
  --> tests/ui/debug_unknown_selector.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |     print("{x#Repr}")
    |               ^^^^
 Why: string interpolation supports a closed selector set — use `#Debug`, `#Fixed(n)`, or `#Unit(name|bare)`
 Fix: write `{value#Debug}`, `{value#Fixed(2)}`, `{value#Unit(name)}`, `{value#Unit(bare)}`, or `{value}`
